From 7d3ec012ad8dc75d4355a98caddb4d89cca8981b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 04:44:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kv-cache): support sparse MLA targets with SWA drafts

Backport vllm-project/vllm@e18f0037a5d54dc2ead5896af896305f2bf57496 to allow A.X-K2 sparse MLA plus the sliding-window DSpark draft to share a compatible full-allocation cache layout without changing sliding-window attention compute.
---
 tests/v1/core/test_kv_cache_utils.py |  77 ++++++++++++-
 vllm/v1/core/kv_cache_utils.py       | 165 ++++++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 181 insertions(+), 61 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/v1/core/test_kv_cache_utils.py b/tests/v1/core/test_kv_cache_utils.py
